<Base title="The Data That Matters"><section class="interior"><div class="eyebrow">WORK / FRAMEWORKS</div><h1>The Data That Matters</h1><p class="lede">Start with business strategy. Measure what matters.</p><div class="callout"><p>Developed through dozens of working sessions across multiple organizations, this is an adaptable framework rather than a fixed presentation series.</p></div><div class="callout"><p>The work starts by bringing cross-functional leaders together around the same business priorities and the same information. Teams compare sources, inputs, transformations, and definitions to identify where apparently shared numbers may tell different stories.</p></div><div class="callout"><p>From there, they define what the business needs to measure, track, and report, clarify ownership, and build a prioritized roadmap for the data strategy that supports the business strategy.</p></div><p><a href="/work/">← Back to Work</a></p></section></Base>